{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Viva La Vida","artist":"Coldplay","date":"2026-08-04","sourceId":"14524675:036","sourceHash":"b42826e8e58043c151340407a208ac1554c9dd3da030d37b6cf299c08e044645","duration":258.32,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":24.18,"end":27.76685009608,"text":"I used to rule the world","translation":"한때 나는 세상을 다스렸지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":27.76685009608,"end":30.947,"text":"Seas would rise when I gave the word","translation":"내가 명하면 바다가 솟아올랐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":30.947,"end":34.427,"text":"Now in the morning, I sleep alone","translation":"이제 아침이면 홀로 잠들고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":35.32,"end":38.54,"text":"Sweep the streets I used to own","translation":"한때 내 것이던 거리를 쓸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":52.75,"end":55.6,"text":"I used to roll the dice","translation":"한때 나는 주사위를 굴렸지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":55.9,"end":59.071,"text":"Feel the fear in my enemy's eyes","translation":"적의 눈에 어린 공포를 느끼며","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":59.071,"end":62.611,"text":"Listened as the crowd would sing","translation":"군중이 노래하는 소리를 들었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":62.611,"end":66.231,"text":"\"Now the old king is dead, long live the king\"","translation":"옛 왕은 죽었다 새 왕 만세","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":66.23197704484,"end":69.212,"text":"One minute I held the key","translation":"한순간 열쇠를 쥐고 있었는데","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":69.212,"end":72.632,"text":"Next, the walls were closed on me","translation":"다음 순간 벽이 날 에워쌌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":72.63283020323999,"end":76.153,"text":"And I discovered that my castles stand","translation":"그리고 내 성이 서 있다는 걸 알았지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":76.153,"end":80.07382199987998,"text":"Upon pillars of salt and pillars of sand","translation":"소금 기둥과 모래 기둥 위에","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":80.07382199987998,"end":84.234,"text":"I hear Jerusalem bells a-ringing","translation":"예루살렘 종소리가 울리는 걸 들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":84.234,"end":87.794,"text":"Roman cavalry choirs are singing","translation":"로마 기병대의 합창이 노래해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":87.79485112219999,"end":91.235,"text":"Be my mirror, my sword and shield","translation":"나의 거울 나의 칼과 방패가 되어 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":91.235,"end":94.855,"text":"My missionaries in a foreign field","translation":"낯선 땅에 선 나의 선교사들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":94.85579226255999,"end":97.736,"text":"For some reason, I can't explain","translation":"무슨 까닭인지 설명할 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":97.736,"end":101.016,"text":"Once you'd gone, there was never","translation":"네가 떠난 뒤로는 한 번도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":101.01661342751999,"end":104.057,"text":"Never an honest word","translation":"단 한마디의 진실도 없었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":104.68,"end":108.6,"text":"And that was when I ruled the world","translation":"그때는 내가 세상을 다스렸지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":118.0,"end":125.3,"text":"It was a wicked and wild wind","translation":"사악하고 거센 바람이었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":125.55988475676,"end":128.38,"text":"Blew down the doors to let me in","translation":"문을 무너뜨려 나를 들여보냈지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":128.38,"end":132.221,"text":"Shattered windows and the sound of drums","translation":"깨진 창문과 북소리","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":132.56081789875998,"end":135.621,"text":"People couldn't believe what I'd become","translation":"사람들은 내가 변한 모습을 믿지 못했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":135.621,"end":138.861,"text":"Revolutionaries wait","translation":"혁명가들은 기다려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":138.86165772656,"end":142.222,"text":"For my head on a silver plate","translation":"은쟁반 위에 놓일 내 머리를","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":142.222,"end":145.722,"text":"Just a puppet on a lonely string","translation":"외로운 줄에 매달린 꼭두각시","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":145.72257220571998,"end":149.643,"text":"Oh, who would ever want to be king?","translation":"누가 왕이 되길 바라겠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":149.903,"end":153.74364131983998,"text":"I hear Jerusalem bells a-ringing","translation":"예루살렘 종소리가 울리는 걸 들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":153.74364131983998,"end":157.384,"text":"Roman cavalry choirs are singing","translation":"로마 기병대의 합창이 노래해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":157.384,"end":160.824,"text":"Be my mirror, my sword and shield","translation":"나의 거울 나의 칼과 방패가 되어 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":160.82458512632,"end":164.425,"text":"My missionaries in a foreign field","translation":"낯선 땅에 선 나의 선교사들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":164.425,"end":167.285,"text":"For some reason, I can't explain","translation":"무슨 까닭인지 설명할 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":167.285,"end":170.925,"text":"I know Saint Peter won't call my name","translation":"성 베드로는 내 이름을 부르지 않겠지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":170.92593151691997,"end":173.886,"text":"Never an honest word","translation":"단 한마디의 진실도 없었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":173.886,"end":177.747,"text":"But that was when I ruled the world","translation":"하지만 그때는 내가 세상을 다스렸지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":205.55054657063997,"end":209.351,"text":"Hear Jerusalem bells a-ringing","translation":"예루살렘 종소리가 울리는 걸 들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":209.351,"end":213.051,"text":"Roman cavalry choirs are singing","translation":"로마 기병대의 합창이 노래해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":213.05154636563998,"end":216.43199693991997,"text":"Be my mirror, my sword and shield","translation":"나의 거울 나의 칼과 방패가 되어 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":216.43199693991997,"end":219.772,"text":"My missionaries in a foreign field","translation":"낯선 땅에 선 나의 선교사들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":219.772,"end":223.432,"text":"For some reason, I can't explain","translation":"무슨 까닭인지 설명할 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":223.43293008191998,"end":226.573,"text":"I know Saint Peter won't call my name","translation":"성 베드로는 내 이름을 부르지 않겠지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":226.573,"end":229.293,"text":"Never an honest word","translation":"단 한마디의 진실도 없었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":229.8,"end":234.36,"text":"But that was when I ruled the world","translation":"하지만 그때는 내가 세상을 다스렸지","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}